    skos:related vokdata:Decrease ;
    skos:scopeNote "Caution: 'tr3tog' is the US abbreviation of this concept and the UK abbreviation of DoubleCrochetThreeTogether (double crochet three together). 'treble crochet three together' is the US name of this concept and the UK name of DoubleCrochetThreeTogether (double crochet three together)."@en-US ;
    dcat:contactPoint "https://github.com/UteBroenner" .

